- How to detect language and manage code-switching at runtime?
- How to scale dictionaries across dozens of languages while preserving privacy?

## Why This Is Asked

Targets hallucination risk, retrieval provenance, and privacy in a real-time multilingual setting, a practical pain point in enterprise support.

## Key Concepts

- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with private KB
- On-device inference, edge caching, latency budgeting
- Multi-language alignment and provenance tokens
- Hallucination detection, data redaction, drift monitoring

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: integrate on-device summarizer with retrieval module
async function summarize(chatChunk, kb) {
  const onDeviceSummary = await onDeviceModel.encodeDecode(chatChunk);
  const docs = kb.lookup(chatChunk, topK=5);
  const finalSummary = await ragGenerate(onDeviceSummary, docs);
  return { summary: finalSummary.text, provenance: finalSummary.provenance };
}
```

